	"powerups/chain_proc": "Every hit carries a proc coefficient (an attack or battery 1, a lightning jump chain_proc, a torpedo torpedo_proc, a burn fire_proc): proc chances are multiplied by it, and a hit a powerup started can\'t start that powerup again, so chains stay fun without running away.",
